\doxysubsubsection{\texorpdfstring{BleTransmit\_Task()}{BleTransmit\_Task()}}
{\footnotesize\ttfamily void Ble\+Transmit\+\_\+\+Task (\begin{DoxyParamCaption}\item[{void $\ast$}]{pv\+Parameter }\end{DoxyParamCaption})}



Free\+RTOS task running on Core 0 acting as a BLE Client to transmit matrix data. 

Scans for the target BLE peripheral, establishes a connection, adjusts the MTU size, and waits for frames in the Free\+RTOS queue to transmit as a 64-\/byte ASCII payload. 
