\index{Final\_Project.ino@{Final\_Project.ino}!JoystickCheck\_Task@{JoystickCheck\_Task}}
\index{JoystickCheck\_Task@{JoystickCheck\_Task}!Final\_Project.ino@{Final\_Project.ino}}
\doxysubsubsection{\texorpdfstring{JoystickCheck\_Task()}{JoystickCheck\_Task()}}
{\footnotesize\ttfamily void Joystick\+Check\+\_\+\+Task (\begin{DoxyParamCaption}\item[{void $\ast$}]{pv\+Parameter }\end{DoxyParamCaption})}



Free\+RTOS task running on Core 1 to monitor joystick inputs and update the drawing matrix. 

Reads analog inputs from the joystick, updates the internal coordinate trackers, illuminates the corresponding LED, and packages the final matrix frame into a queue upon button press. 
\begin{DoxyParams}{Parameters}
{\em pv\+Parameter} & Pointer to Free\+RTOS task parameters (unused). \\
\hline
\end{DoxyParams}
\begin{DoxyReturn}{Returns}
None 
\end{DoxyReturn}
