Helper function to update the local MAX7219 LED matrix display. 

Can either illuminate a specific coordinate or execute a full hardware and software reset of the canvas. 
\begin{DoxyParams}{Parameters}
{\em x} & X-\/coordinate (column) to illuminate. \\
\hline
{\em y} & Y-\/coordinate (row) to illuminate. \\
\hline
{\em clear} & Boolean flag. If true, the matrix hardware and local tracker are wiped clean. \\
